# Binaries
*.exe
*.-windows.exe

# Object files
*.obj
*.o
*.a

# Libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Go executable binary, built at the root by `go build ./cmd/battleserver`.
# Anchored to the root on purpose: unanchored, this pattern also matched the
# directory cmd/battleserver/, and `git add .` then skipped the server's only
# entry point. The files stayed on disk, so `go build ./...` kept passing and
# `git status` kept reporting a clean tree, while no clone could build the
# server and scripts/deploy.ps1 threw on `./cmd/battleserver`.
/battleserver

# Go build cache
/*.exe
/*.test

# IDE and editor temporary files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Experimental golang.org/x tools
# golang.org/x/tools/gopls
/gopls*

# Dump support files
/tmp/

# GoReleaser output
/dist/
/.goreleaser.yaml

# ago
*.env

docs/